<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Convert Chase and other bank CSV exports to ledger-cli plain text accounting format using AI. Free, private, runs locally.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="local ledger, ledger-cli, plain text accounting, bank csv converter, chase csv ledger, hledger, csv to ledger">
    <meta name="author" content="Local Ledger">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
    
    <title>Local Ledger - Bank CSV to Ledger-CLI Converter</title>
    
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://local-ledger.com/">
    
    <meta property="og:title" content="Local Ledger - Bank CSV to Ledger-CLI Converter">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Convert Chase and other bank CSV exports to ledger-cli plain text accounting format using AI. Free, private, runs locally.">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://local-ledger.com/">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://local-ledger.com/og-image.png">
    <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png">
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Local Ledger - Convert Bank CSV to Ledger Format">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://local-ledger.com/og-image.png">
    <script defer data-domain="local-ledger.com" src="https://plausible.iacutone.synology.me/js/script.js"></script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "WebApplication",
      "name": "Local Ledger",
      "url": "https://local-ledger.com",
      "description": "Convert Chase and other bank CSV exports to ledger-cli plain text accounting format using AI.",
      "applicationCategory": "FinanceApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "Web",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "0",
        "priceCurrency": "USD"
      }
    }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <h1 class="site-title">Local Ledger</h1>
      <div class="header-buttons">
        <button onclick="openInstructionsModal()" class="btn-secondary">Instructions</button>
        <button onclick="openAboutModal()" class="btn-secondary">About</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="main">
      <p class="subtitle">Convert bank CSV exports to ledger-cli format using AI</p>
      <div class="upload-area">
        <input type="file" id="csvFile" accept=".csv" onchange="onFileSelected()" />
        <button id="uploadBtn" onclick="uploadFile()" style="display:none;">Upload & Process</button>
      </div>
      <div id="status" class="status"></div>
      <div id="classificationPrompt" class="response" style="display:none;margin-top:1rem;">
        <strong>Category needed</strong>
        <p id="classificationDetails"></p>
        <p style="color:#858585;font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0.75rem;">
          The AI wasn't confident enough to auto-classify this transaction. Start typing below to search existing categories, or enter a new one using the format <code>Expenses:Category:Subcategory</code> (e.g. <code>Expenses:Food:Restaurants</code>). Your choice will be remembered for this merchant going forward.
        </p>
        <label for="entryName">Account</label>
        <input id="entryName" list="accountOptions" style="width:100%;margin-top:0.5rem;" />
        <datalist id="accountOptions"></datalist>
        <button onclick="submitClassification()" style="margin-top:0.75rem;">Continue</button>
      </div>
      <button id="downloadBtn" style="display:none;margin-top:1rem;" onclick="downloadLedger()">Download Journal</button>
      <div id="reports" style="display:none;">
        <h2>Account balances</h2>
        <div id="balance" class="response"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="response" class="response" style="display:none;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Instructions Modal -->
    <div id="instructionsModal" class="modal" style="display:none;">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close" onclick="closeInstructionsModal()">&times;</span>
        <h2>Instructions</h2>
        
        <h3>How to Use</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Download your credit card or bank statement as a CSV file</li>
          <li>Click "Choose File" and select your CSV</li>
          <li>Click "Upload & Process" to convert to ledger format</li>
          <li>Download the journal file if you want to keep it</li>
        </ol>

        <h3>Supported Banks</h3>
        <p>This tool is optimized for <strong>Chase credit card</strong> CSV exports. Other banks may work but results may vary.</p>

        <h3>Need Help?</h3>
        <p>If you encounter any issues or would like to add support for your bank's CSV format, please reach out:</p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem;">
          <a href="mailto:iacutone@protonmail.com" style="color:#4ec9b0;">iacutone@protonmail.com</a>
        </p>
        <p style="color:#858585;font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:1rem;">Include a sample of your CSV headers (without personal data) and I'll work on extending the model to support it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About Modal -->
    <div id="aboutModal" class="modal" style="display:none;">
      <div class="modal-content">
        <span class="close" onclick="closeAboutModal()">&times;</span>
        <h2>About Local Ledger</h2>
        <p>Local Ledger is a tool that converts bank CSV transaction files into plain text ledger format using AI.</p>
        
        <h3>Why Plain Text Accounting?</h3>
        <p>Plain text accounting offers several advantages:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Your financial data stays on your machine</li>
          <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Text files work everywhere, forever</li>
          <li><strong>Version Control:</strong> Track changes with git</li>
          <li><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Use any text editor or tool</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>How It Works</h3>
        <p>Upload your bank's CSV export, and Local Ledger uses a local AI model (Ollama) to convert it to a ledger journal and show account balances.</p>

        <h3>Privacy First</h3>
        <p>Processing happens on my server. Classification corrections are stored in a minimal local training log; dates and card identifiers are not retained.</p>

        <p style="margin-top:2rem;"><a href="https://thoughts.iacut.one/local-ledger/" target="_blank" style="color:#4ec9b0;">Read more on the blog →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script>
      let ledgerContent = '';
      let ledgerFilename = 'credit-card.ledger';
      let activeWebSocket = null;
      let pendingClassification = null;

      function onFileSelected() {
        const fileInput = document.getElementById('csvFile');
        const uploadBtn = document.getElementById('uploadBtn');
        uploadBtn.style.display = fileInput.files.length > 0 ? 'inline-block' : 'none';
      }

      function uploadFile() {
        const fileInput = document.getElementById('csvFile');
        const file = fileInput.files[0];
        if (!file) {
          alert('Please select a file');
          return;
        }

        const uploadBtn = document.getElementById('uploadBtn');
        uploadBtn.disabled = true;
        uploadBtn.textContent = 'Processing...';

        const reader = new FileReader();
        reader.onload = function(e) {
          const csvContent = e.target.result;
          processWithWebSocket(csvContent, file.name);
        };
        reader.readAsText(file);
      }

      function processWithWebSocket(csvContent, filename) {
        const statusDiv = document.getElementById('status');
        const responseDiv = document.getElementById('response');
        const reportsDiv = document.getElementById('reports');
        const balanceDiv = document.getElementById('balance');
        const downloadBtn = document.getElementById('downloadBtn');
        document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'none';
        pendingClassification = null;
        
        statusDiv.textContent = 'Connecting...';
        responseDiv.style.display = 'none';
        responseDiv.textContent = '';
        reportsDiv.style.display = 'none';
        balanceDiv.textContent = '';
        downloadBtn.style.display = 'none';
        document.getElementById('uploadBtn').style.display = 'none';
        ledgerContent = '';
        ledgerFilename = 'credit-card.ledger';

        const protocol = window.location.protocol === 'https:' ? 'wss:' : 'ws:';
        const ws = new WebSocket(protocol + '//' + window.location.host + '/ws');
        activeWebSocket = ws;

        ws.onmessage = function(event) {
          const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
          
          if (data.type === 'progress') {
            statusDiv.textContent = 'Processing transaction ' + data.current + ' of ' + data.total + '...';
            statusDiv.style.color = '#858585';
          } else if (data.type === 'needs_classification') {
            pendingClassification = data;
            document.getElementById('classificationDetails').textContent =
              data.description + ' — ' + (data.bank_category || 'no bank category') +
              ' — ' + data.amount + (data.suggested_account ? ' (suggested: ' + data.suggested_account + ')' : '');
            const input = document.getElementById('entryName');
            input.value = data.suggested_account || '';
            const options = document.getElementById('accountOptions');
            options.innerHTML = '';
            (data.accounts || []).forEach(function(account) {
              const option = document.createElement('option');
              option.value = account;
              options.appendChild(option);
            });
            document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'block';
            statusDiv.textContent = 'Please choose an account to continue';
            statusDiv.style.color = '#dcdcaa';
          } else if (data.type === 'progress_message') {
            statusDiv.textContent = data.message;
            statusDiv.style.color = '#858585';
          } else if (data.type === 'report') {
            document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'none';
            statusDiv.textContent = 'Done';
            statusDiv.style.color = '#858585';
            reportsDiv.style.display = 'block';
            balanceDiv.textContent = data.balance || '(no balances)';
            ledgerContent = data.journal || '';
            if (data.download) ledgerFilename = data.download;
            downloadBtn.style.display = 'inline-block';
          } else if (data.type === 'report_error') {
            document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'none';
            statusDiv.textContent = 'ledger: ' + data.message;
            statusDiv.style.color = '#f48771';
            ledgerContent = data.journal || '';
            if (data.download) ledgerFilename = data.download;
            if (ledgerContent) {
              responseDiv.style.display = 'block';
              responseDiv.textContent = ledgerContent;
              downloadBtn.style.display = 'inline-block';
            }
          } else if (data.type === 'error') {
            document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'none';
            statusDiv.textContent = 'Error: ' + data.message;
            statusDiv.style.color = '#f48771';
          }
        };

        ws.onopen = function() {
          statusDiv.textContent = 'Connected. Processing...';
          // Send CSV content first
          ws.send(JSON.stringify({
            action: 'process',
            csv_content: csvContent,
            filename: filename
          }));
          // Then signal ready to start processing
          ws.send(JSON.stringify({ action: 'ready' }));
        };

        ws.onerror = function(error) {
          statusDiv.textContent = 'Error: ' + error;
        };

        ws.onclose = function() {
          console.log('WebSocket closed');
        };
      }

      function submitClassification() {
        const input = document.getElementById('entryName');
        const account = input.value.trim();
        if (!activeWebSocket || !pendingClassification || !account) {
          alert('Enter an account name to continue');
          return;
        }

        activeWebSocket.send(JSON.stringify({
          action: 'classify',
          row_number: pendingClassification.row_number,
          account: account
        }));
        document.getElementById('classificationPrompt').style.display = 'none';
        document.getElementById('status').textContent = 'Continuing...';
        pendingClassification = null;
      }

      function downloadLedger() {
        const blob = new Blob([ledgerContent], { type: 'text/plain' });
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = ledgerFilename;
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        document.body.removeChild(a);
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
      }

      function openAboutModal() {
        document.getElementById('aboutModal').style.display = 'block';
      }

      function closeAboutModal() {
        document.getElementById('aboutModal').style.display = 'none';
      }

      function openInstructionsModal() {
        document.getElementById('instructionsModal').style.display = 'block';
      }

      function closeInstructionsModal() {
        document.getElementById('instructionsModal').style.display = 'none';
      }

      window.onclick = function(event) {
        const aboutModal = document.getElementById('aboutModal');
        const instructionsModal = document.getElementById('instructionsModal');
        if (event.target == aboutModal) {
          closeAboutModal();
        }
        if (event.target == instructionsModal) {
          closeInstructionsModal();
        }
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        font-family: sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #1e1e1e;
        color: #d4d4d4;
      }

      /* Header */
      .header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #3e3e42;
      }

      .site-title {
        color: #4ec9b0;
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .header-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      /* Main content */
      .main {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .subtitle {
        color: #858585;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      /* Upload area */
      .upload-area {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
      }

      input[type="file"] {
        color: #d4d4d4;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      /* Buttons */
      button {
        background: #4ec9b0;
        color: #1e1e1e;
        border: none;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 1rem;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      button:hover { background: #6ed9c0; }
      button:disabled { background: #555; color: #888; cursor: not-allowed; }

      .btn-secondary { background: #858585; color: #1e1e1e; }
      .btn-secondary:hover { background: #9e9e9e; }

      /* Status */
      .status { color: #858585; margin: 1rem 0; }

      /* Response blocks */
      .response {
        white-space: pre;
        background: #252526;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        font-family: Monaco, monospace;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        overflow-x: auto;
        border: 1px solid #3e3e42;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      h2 { color: #4ec9b0; margin-top: 2rem; }
      h3 { color: #6ed9c0; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
      a { color: #4ec9b0; text-decoration: none; }
      a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
      ul, ol { line-height: 1.8; }
      code { background: #2d2d2d; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 3px; font-family: Monaco, monospace; font-size: 0.85em; color: #ce9178; }

      /* Modals */
      .modal {
        position: fixed;
        z-index: 1000;
        inset: 0;
        overflow: auto;
        background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 2rem 1rem;
      }

      .modal-content {
        background-color: #252526;
        padding: 2rem;
        border: 1px solid #3e3e42;
        border-radius: 8px;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 700px;
        max-height: 85vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }

      .close {
        color: #858585;
        float: right;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        cursor: pointer;
        line-height: 20px;
      }
      .close:hover, .close:focus { color: #d4d4d4; }

      /* Mobile */
      @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .header { padding: 1rem; }
        .site-title { font-size: 1.2rem; }
        .main { padding: 1rem; }
        .response { font-size: 12px; padding: 1rem; }
        button { font-size: 0.9rem; }
      }
    </style>

  </body>
</html>
